{"id":"n67096-1-4","stage":5,"title":"엄두 · 念头","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67096-1-4-1","ko":"해외여행을 혼자 가는 것도 괜찮던데.","zh":"一个人去国外旅行好像也没什么问题啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"해외여행을","meaning":"海外旅行，境外游","explanation":"해외여행：海外旅行，境外游；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"해외여행","audio":"/audio/f6c86ac307762c16c445.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72474","senseId":"1","lemma":"해외여행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"혼자","meaning":"独自地，单独地","explanation":"혼자：独自地，单独地","readings":[{"term":"혼자","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30208","senseId":"1","lemma":"혼자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가는","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것도","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"괜찮던데.","meaning":"无恙，没事","explanation":"괜찮다：无恙，没事；던데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"괜찮다","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60097","senseId":"2","lemma":"괜찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f6c86ac307762c16","term":"해외여행","zh":"海外旅行，境外游","audio":"/audio/f6c86ac307762c16c445.mp3","entryId":"72474","definition":"去国外旅行；或指这种旅行。","pronunciation":["해ː외여행","해ː웨여행"]},{"id":"9d309cd460ea409c","term":"혼자","zh":"独自地，单独地","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3","entryId":"30208","definition":"没有其他人地。","pronunciation":["혼자"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"b9a2699f824000e3","term":"괜찮다","zh":"无恙，没事","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3","entryId":"60097","definition":"没有特别的问题。","pronunciation":["괜찬타"]}],"audio":"/audio/e2b6b68ce6706e527736.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67096-1-4-2","ko":"난 겁이 많아서 도저히 혼자 갈 엄두가 안 나.","zh":"我太胆小了，根本不敢一个人去。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"난","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"겁이","meaning":"胆怯，害怕","explanation":"겁：胆怯，害怕；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"겁","audio":"/audio/3404e2048e920796c6ec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62260","senseId":"1","lemma":"겁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많아서","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"도저히","meaning":"怎么也，无论如何，绝对","explanation":"도저히：怎么也，无论如何，绝对","readings":[{"term":"도저히","audio":"/audio/f875011623286e4a315b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14397","senseId":"1","lemma":"도저히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"혼자","meaning":"独自地，单独地","explanation":"혼자：独自地，单独地","readings":[{"term":"혼자","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30208","senseId":"1","lemma":"혼자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갈","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"엄두가","meaning":"念头，想法","explanation":"엄두：念头，想法；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"엄두","audio":"/audio/2b4ebfa169a0b52030a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67096","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나.","meaning":"表示前面叙述的动作已经结束。","explanation":"나다：表示前面叙述的动作已经结束。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62134","senseId":"2","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"3404e2048e920796","term":"겁","zh":"胆怯，害怕","audio":"/audio/3404e2048e920796c6ec.mp3","entryId":"62260","definition":"因为恐惧而感到不安的心情。","pronunciation":["겁"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]},{"id":"f875011623286e4a","term":"도저히","zh":"怎么也，无论如何，绝对","audio":"/audio/f875011623286e4a315b.mp3","entryId":"14397","definition":"不管怎么做也。","pronunciation":["도ː저히"]},{"id":"9d309cd460ea409c","term":"혼자","zh":"独自地，单独地","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3","entryId":"30208","definition":"没有其他人地。","pronunciation":["혼자"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"2b4ebfa169a0b520","term":"엄두","zh":"念头，想法","audio":"/audio/2b4ebfa169a0b52030a9.mp3","entryId":"67096","definition":"岂敢做某事的心。","pronunciation":["엄두"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"表示前面叙述的动作已经结束。","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62134","definition":"表示前面叙述的动作已经结束。","pronunciation":["나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/094382d77aee645c2675.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.333,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67096","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":159,"sequenceScore":3.1597,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我太胆小了，根本不敢一个人去。","啊，看来我的脚踝扭伤了。","一个人去国外旅行好像也没什么问题啊。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我太胆小了，根本不敢一个人去。","一个人去国外旅行好像也没什么问题啊。","啊，看来我的脚踝扭伤了。"],"answer":0}]}
